# Mobile phone builds (no dev server)

When Alex asks for a build “on my phone”, “for the device”, “installable”, or similar:

- Use EAS profile **`preview`** (internal, standalone) or **`production`**.
- **Never** use profile **`development`** for phone installs. That profile sets `developmentClient: true` and the app will refuse to run without Metro.
- Do not start Metro / `expo start` as a substitute for a phone install unless Alex explicitly wants a development client session.
- Prefer: `eas build --platform ios --profile preview` (or android) from `mobile/`.

The `development` profile remains for local/dev-client workflows only when Alex asks for a development client by name.
